{"id":"wb-4-188","name":"伊犁将军府","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"伊犁将军府","text":"伊犁将军府是清代伊犁将军的驻地。伊犁将军府始建于乾隆年间，后被毁，现存遗址为光绪年间所建，位于中华人民共和国新疆维吾尔自治区伊犁哈萨克自治州霍城县惠远镇。伊犁将军府于1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E7%8A%81%E5%B0%86%E5%86%9B%E5%BA%9C","revisionId":89524109,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89524109","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核名称、所在地与对应遗址；原名录行政地址及参考点位不作为唯一判断依据","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4f2c7917fcc16bbfa2cc0e50.jpg","title":"伊犁将军府_the_Ili_Commandery.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BC%8A%E7%8A%81%E5%B0%86%E5%86%9B%E5%BA%9C_the_Ili_Commandery.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/%E4%BC%8A%E7%8A%81%E5%B0%86%E5%86%9B%E5%BA%9C_the_Ili_Commandery.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"HaziiDozen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​伊犁将军府 the Ili Commandery","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图"}}